  "rules": [
    "Keep different units separate.",
    "Count successful correctness-validated completions, not offered requests or scanned rows.",
    "Require simultaneous measurement windows before aggregating nodes of the same workload.",
    "Never multiply single-node QPS into a claimed distributed measurement.",
    "Record source, artifact hashes, compiler, release profile, fixture, topology, errors and latency.",
    "Spend requires a bounded run allocation and remaining-budget check.",
    "A running agent must be independently observable performing or awaiting a real assigned task within the same measurement interval; registered or idle records alone do not count."
